      "id": 13641,
      "name": "inkomo",
      "username": "inkomo",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/i/6bbea6/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-09-22T18:28:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<div><div>A good friend of mine is in charge of interactive gaming at ShadoCon this year. He comes over to my house at least once a week to play Sentinels of the Multiverse, and has asked me to run the card game in the game room at the convention all three days. I noticed that during the \"Sentinel Tactics tournaments in your own store\", the page has graphics showing \"ask for more information\" and was wondering if informational material like that was available for the card game that I could pass out to anyone interested. If there are any posters / flyers / business cards that could be sent to me, I will set them up at the table and distrubute them.<br><div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Attached is 2 photos of my collection of the card game (minus WotC which I have but has not been added yet) that I will be bringing to play (unofficial stuff, Cauldron, would be left home if official materials are displayed). Also here is more information about the convention:</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>ShadoCon Year 6 - expected adenance of over 3,000 people - Palm Harbor, FL - November 6-8 - <a href=\"https://3c.gmx.net/mail/client/dereferrer?redirectUrl=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.shadocon.com%2F\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.shadocon.com/</a>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Sean Silmser - Interactive Gaming Coordinator - <a href=\"https://3c.gmx.net/mail/client/dereferrer?redirectUrl=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.shadocon.com%2Finformation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.shadocon.com/information</a>&nbsp; (\"Contact Us\" tab, at the bottom)</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>I have read the following threads to get a baseline way to setup / run the game:</div>\n<div>https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/u-con-tips-for-running-sotm-cons-4298</div>\n<div>https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/spiel-for-teaching-3315</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Thank you,</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Bill</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>p.s. - I will have pictures taken of the game play during the convention</div>\n</div></div><p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
